{"facts":[{"id":"fact_1","kind":"want","text":"Find the dwarves' hoard marked on the party's map, which was Bral's map.","state":"open","change":"updated","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior","beat_74","beat_75"]},{"id":"fact_new_1","kind":"could_use","text":"Grimny's ghost said Bral probably hid the hoard in the Dragon's Lair. The dwarves had scouted that cave as a hiding spot, and it was then empty, unvisited and very small, just one big room.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_2"],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_77"]},{"id":"fact_new_2","kind":"could_use","text":"The party's map marks the Dragon's Lair and the Dwarven mine. Dr. Uriah's Read Languages spell lets him read the writing under one map location per day.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_2"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_19","beat_20","beat_22"]},{"id":"fact_new_3","kind":"blocked_by","text":"The hoard probably lies in the Dragon's Lair, so the dragon stands between the party and the treasure.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":"thread_2","also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_20","beat_77"]},{"id":"fact_new_4","kind":"unknown","text":"What is the remaining unidentified location marked on the map? Sir Phidipaldi guesses it is King Hogboon's.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_22","beat_67"]}]}